# Code owners: a pull request touching these paths needs a code owner's review
# before it can merge (branch protection on main requires it).
#
# These are the paths that decide what CI runs, what the repository's scripts,
# launchers and git hooks do on a contributor's machine, how cargo builds,
# which third-party code is fetched and how it is patched, and what a release
# contains and how it is verified. The maintainers are listed in
# GOVERNANCE.md.

